  "title": "Ex 4.1 · The square of an even integer",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $x$ be an even integer. Show that $x^2$ is even.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
