  "hints": [
    "By the definition of even, an even integer is 2 times some integer. Write x that way with a new letter.",
    "Square it and pull out a factor of 2."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $x$ is even, $x = 2a$ for some integer $a$.",
    "Then $x^2 = 4a^2 = 2(2a^2)$, and $2a^2$ is an integer, so $x^2$ is even. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
